TI  - Dysautonomia and Postural Orthostatic Tachycardia Syndrome (POTS) in the ENT Clinic: Differentiating Orthostatic Dizziness From Vestibular Migraine and Persistent Postural-Perceptual Dizziness (PPPD).
AU  - Zitser P
AU  - Kolomiyets I
AU  - Imran M
AU  - Kulkarni A
AU  - Patel J
AU  - St Martin N
AU  - Ahmadi A.
PY  - 2026
JO  - Cureus
VL  - 18
