TI  - A Phase 1 clinical trial to evaluate the safety and tolerability of CLZ-2002 for the treatment of patients with Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 1.
AU  - Kim H
AU  - Choi BO
AU  - Lee H
AU  - Park S
AU  - Lim J
AU  - Jung SC.
PY  - 2026
