TI  - Treatment of intracranial aneurysms. Reconstruction of the parent artery with flow-diverting (Silk) stent.
AU  - Wagner Aase
AU  - Cortsen Marie
AU  - Hauerberg John
AU  - Romner Bertil
AU  - Wagner Mathias Pedersen
