TI  - Long-term occlusion results with SILK flow diversion in 28 aneurysms: Do recanalizations occur during follow-up?
AU  - Mpotsaris Anastasios
AU  - Skalej Martin
AU  - Beuing Oliver
AU  - Eckert Bernd
AU  - Behme Daniel
AU  - Weber Werner
PY  - 2015
