TI  - Dynamic causal modeling in PTSD and its dissociative subtype: Bottom-up versus top-down processing within fear and emotion regulation circuitry.
AU  - Nicholson Andrew A
AU  - Friston Karl J
AU  - Zeidman Peter
AU  - Harricharan Sherain
