TI  - Execution of natural manipulation in the air enhances the beta-rhythm intermuscular coherences of the human arm depending on muscle pairs.
AU  - Ohtsuka Hiroyuki
AU  - Nakajima Tsuyoshi
AU  - Komiyama Tomoyoshi
