TI  - Nurse led first seizure clinics-a dangerous experiment or an effective alternative to the norm?
AU  - Tittensor Phil
AU  - Siddiqui Shoaib
AU  - Charles Rosie
AU  - Russell Daniel
AU  - Schnabel Elizabeth
AU  - Smyth Conor
AU  - Rowe Jacqui-Dawn
