TI  - Who benefits from multidisciplinary care in functional somatic disorders? Identifying cost-effective patient selection through diagnostic classification groups
AU  - Hammerman O.
AU  - Rasooly A.
AU  - Greenberg D.
AU  - Kushnir T.
AU  - Yaakobi E.
AU  - Ezra Y.
