TI  - Diagnosis and treatment of the first epileptic seizure: Guidelines of the Italian League against Epilepsy
AU  - Beghi E.
AU  - De Maria G.
AU  - Gobbi G.
AU  - Veneselli E.
PY  - 2006
JO  - Epilepsia
VL  - 47
