TI  - Variety of antiprion compounds discovered through an in silico screen based on cellular-form prion protein structure: Correlation between antiprion activity and binding affinity
AU  - Hosokawa-Muto J.
AU  - Kamatari Y.
AU  - Nakamura H.
AU  - Kuwata K.
PY  - 2009
JO  - Antimicrobial Agents and Chemotherapy
VL  - 53
