TI  - Evaluation of the risk factors for a rotator cuff retear after repair surgery
AU  - Lee Y.S.
AU  - Jeong J.Y.
AU  - Park C.D.
AU  - Kang S.G.
AU  - Yoo J.C.
PY  - 2017
JO  - American Journal of Sports Medicine
VL  - 45
IS  - 8
