TI  - Transient in-stent stenosis at mid-term angiographic follow-up in patients treated with SILK flow diverter stents: Incidence, clinical significance and long-term follow-up
AU  - Essbaiheen F.
AU  - Alqahtani H.
AU  - Almansoori T.M.
AU  - Cora E.A.
AU  - Patro S.
AU  - Tsehmaister-Abitbul V.
AU  - Drake B.
