TI  - Correction to: Patterns and utility of myelin oligodendrocyte glycoprotein (MOG) antibody testing in cerebrospinal fluid (Journal of Neurology, (2024), 271, 5, (2662-2671), 10.1007/s00415-024-12213-7)
AU  - Burton J.M.
