TI  - The role of ubiquitin C–terminal hydrolase (UCH-L1) and protein S100B in differentiating patients with epileptic and psychogenic non-epileptic seizures – Pilot study
AU  - Dapic Ivancic B.
AU  - Petelin Gadze Z.
