TI  - Spontaneous Resolution of Pharyngeal Myoclonus in a Child: An Uncommon Case With Objective Clicking Sounds.
AU  - Yokoyama, Koji
AU  - Mamada, Mitsukazu
PY  - 2025
JO  - Cureus
VL  - 17
IS  - 8
SP  - e89518-e89518
