TI  - The angular course of the median nerve in the distal forearm and its anatomical importance in preventing nerve injury in a modern era of carpal tunnel release
AU  - Payne, Russell
AU  - Nasralah, Zeinab
AU  - Sieg, Emily
AU  - Rizk, Elias B.
AU  - Glantz, Michael
AU  - Harbaugh, Kimberly
