TI  - Neuroinflammation as a pathophysiological factor in the development and maintenance of functional seizures: A hypothesis
AU  - Sharma, Ayushe A.
AU  - Szaflarski, Jerzy P.
PY  - 2021
JO  - EPILEPSY & BEHAVIOR REPORTS
VL  - 16
