TI  - Fractal dimensions and machine learning for detection of Parkinson's disease in resting-state electroencephalography
AU  - Lal, Utkarsh
AU  - Chikkankod, Arjun Vinayak
AU  - Longo, Luca
PY  - 2024
JO  - NEURAL COMPUTING & APPLICATIONS
