TI  - Accurate identification of individuals with subjective cognitive decline using 3D regional fractal dimensions on structural magnetic resonance imaging
AU  - Ni, Huangjing
AU  - Xue, Jing
AU  - Qin, Jiaolong
AU  - Zhang, Yu
PY  - 2024
JO  - COMPUTER METHODS AND PROGRAMS IN BIOMEDICINE
